WHY THE SPLIT
-------------

The structure is what is being given away. The words are not, because a CV and
a body of writing under a permissive software licence could be reposted
verbatim by anyone, including under someone else's name.

That is the same boundary `/architecture` draws when it invites replication —
it publishes the repositories and the bar, not the author's record. But the
invitation on that page is an invitation; `LICENSE` and this file are the
licence.
